// ============================================================================
//  tmrLoad.Start  —  REACTIVE trigger.
//  This formula re-evaluates whenever PowerBIIntegration.Data changes. The
//  moment the row count differs from what we last built (incl. 0 -> N when the
//  Power BI data first arrives, or N -> M on a slicer change), it returns true,
//  which starts the timer -> OnTimerEnd rebuilds -> it sets varRowCount and the
//  expression goes false again. No polling, no navigation needed.
//
//  Set tmrLoad.AutoStart = false  and  tmrLoad.Repeat = false.
// ============================================================================
CountRows( PowerBIIntegration.Data ) <> varRowCount
